WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.516 --> 00:00:15.337
Things looked really bad for Dr.

2
00:00:15.377 --> 00:00:16.658
Dolittle and his friends.

3
00:00:17.338 --> 00:00:20.981
But then, without warning, someone let out a loud cry.

4
00:00:21.901 --> 00:00:24.183
One native ran toward one of the sick men.

5
00:00:24.863 --> 00:00:25.944
He spoke rapidly.

6
00:00:26.705 --> 00:00:28.045
He had tears in his eyes.

7
00:00:29.106 --> 00:00:30.807
Long Arrow translated for Dr.

8
00:00:32.016 --> 00:00:36.318
Dolittle. "This is the chief's eldest son," he said, pointing to one of the sick men.

9
00:00:36.338 --> 00:00:39.300
"His family thought he was dead.

10
00:00:40.101 --> 00:00:43.542
And the other one, the man with the sword, is his younger brother.

11
00:00:44.403 --> 00:00:47.705
Their father, the chief of Popsipetal, has just died."

12
00:00:47.725 --> 00:00:49.466
"What did he die from?"

13
00:00:49.946 --> 00:00:50.706
asked the doctor.

14
00:00:50.726 --> 00:00:54.028
"They do not know," translated Long Arrow.

15
00:00:54.048 --> 00:00:58.050
"He was bitten by a mosquito and died soon after."

16
00:00:58.791 --> 00:01:00.692
Dr. Dolittle jumped to his feet.

17
00:01:01.456 --> 00:01:02.477
"A mosquito?

18
00:01:02.817 --> 00:01:04.178
Then we must hurry!"

19
00:01:04.198 --> 00:01:06.539
"Ah," Long Arrow said.

20
00:01:06.559 --> 00:01:11.101
"The mosquito must be carrying a disease that spreads through the blood."

21
00:01:11.942 --> 00:01:13.342
Dr. Dolittle nodded.

22
00:01:13.362 --> 00:01:16.724
"Can you help them?"

23
00:01:17.224 --> 00:01:18.145
asked Long Arrow.

24
00:01:18.965 --> 00:01:21.547
Dr. Dolittle looked inside his medicine bag.

25
00:01:21.567 --> 00:01:23.708
"How many natives are there?"

26
00:01:24.068 --> 00:01:24.568
he asked.

27
00:01:24.588 --> 00:01:28.390
"Over one hundred families," answered Long Arrow.

28
00:01:29.171 --> 00:01:31.072
The doctor sadly shook his head.

29
00:01:33.104 --> 00:01:37.328
"I have some medicine, but not enough for everyone," he said.

30
00:01:37.348 --> 00:01:40.370
"Do not worry," Long Arrow replied.

31
00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:42.872
"I know how to stop the sickness.

32
00:01:43.733 --> 00:01:46.195
But we must hurry before others get sick!"

33
00:01:47.136 --> 00:01:51.920
When they reached the village of Popsipetal, several people ran out toward them crying.

34
00:01:52.961 --> 00:01:55.863
One woman sobbed and spoke to the chief's younger son.

35
00:01:55.883 --> 00:02:01.428
"Her baby is very sick from the same mosquito bite," Long Arrow translated.

36
00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:04.289
Dr. Dolittle looked very upset.

37
00:02:05.230 --> 00:02:06.751
Many others were sick, too.

38
00:02:06.771 --> 00:02:08.692
"Tommy, Charles!

39
00:02:09.213 --> 00:02:10.694
I need your help," Dr.

40
00:02:10.714 --> 00:02:11.474
Dolittle said.

41
00:02:13.796 --> 00:02:15.037
The natives helped Dr.

42
00:02:15.077 --> 00:02:16.838
Dolittle set up a small hut.

43
00:02:17.698 --> 00:02:20.180
All the sick people were put inside the hut.

44
00:02:21.001 --> 00:02:22.321
No one except Dr.

45
00:02:22.381 --> 00:02:24.103
Dolittle was allowed inside.

46
00:02:24.883 --> 00:02:28.926
The doctor rolled up his sleeves and began taking care of the people.

47
00:02:29.726 --> 00:02:32.008
Meanwhile Long Arrow had disappeared.

48
00:02:34.304 --> 00:02:37.986
Tommy and Charles brought fresh water and clean cloths to the doctor.

49
00:02:38.766 --> 00:02:40.227
They worked hard all night.

50
00:02:40.947 --> 00:02:42.928
But more and more people got sick.

51
00:02:43.708 --> 00:02:45.929
And Long Arrow still had not returned.

52
00:02:46.689 --> 00:02:48.790
Tommy wondered where the Indian was.

53
00:02:50.711 --> 00:02:55.133
Finally at dawn, the doctor came out of the hut, extremely tired.

54
00:02:55.153 --> 00:02:57.554
"That's it," he sighed.

55
00:02:57.574 --> 00:02:59.995
"There is no more medicine left."

56
00:03:00.915 --> 00:03:02.536
"But what about all these people?"

57
00:03:03.404 --> 00:03:06.447
Tommy looked at the long line standing in front of the hut.

58
00:03:07.207 --> 00:03:08.729
They were waiting to be treated.

59
00:03:08.749 --> 00:03:12.252
"There must be something you can do," cried Charles.

60
00:03:12.272 --> 00:03:16.856
"I don't know," the doctor said sadly.

61
00:03:16.876 --> 00:03:19.378
"I can't help them anymore."

62
00:03:20.279 --> 00:03:22.901
With those words, the doctor began to cry.

63
00:03:23.642 --> 00:03:25.724
Suddenly the sky began to rumble.

64
00:03:26.524 --> 00:03:29.327
Everyone looked up to see what was causing the sounds.

65
00:03:31.172 --> 00:03:35.093
A large band of eagles flew across the village and into the woods.

66
00:03:35.773 --> 00:03:40.094
They screeched loudly as they soared high up and dived down low.

67
00:03:40.114 --> 00:03:41.855
"What are they saying?"

68
00:03:42.495 --> 00:03:43.715
Tommy asked the doctor.

69
00:03:43.735 --> 00:03:45.796
"It is a miracle."

70
00:03:46.196 --> 00:03:47.577
Dr. Dolittle smiled.

71
00:03:47.597 --> 00:03:51.237
"The eagles are eating up all the mosquitoes!"

72
00:03:51.258 --> 00:03:56.699
"They taste rather disgusting," screamed one eagle.

73
00:03:56.719 --> 00:04:00.100
"Not much flavor," complained another.

74
00:04:00.952 --> 00:04:03.953
"They're not as bad as flies," said a third.

75
00:04:04.713 --> 00:04:11.915
Dr. Dolittle clapped his hands excitedly and yelled, you!

76
00:04:12.075 --> 00:04:14.256
Thank you for saving the people!"

77
00:04:14.276 --> 00:04:20.057
"That little human is speaking our language," said the first eagle.

78
00:04:20.077 --> 00:04:22.558
"Yes, that's the famous Dr.

79
00:04:22.578 --> 00:04:24.399
Dolittle," the second one said.

80
00:04:24.419 --> 00:04:28.640
"Oh, the one Long Arrow told us about," said the third.

81
00:04:29.704 --> 00:04:32.346
"It was Long Arrow who has saved you, not us!"

82
00:04:33.347 --> 00:04:34.008
they shouted.

83
00:04:34.948 --> 00:04:38.211
Just then the largest, grandest eagle flew over them.

84
00:04:38.832 --> 00:04:41.073
Sitting on its back was Long Arrow.

85
00:04:41.093 --> 00:04:46.217
"I have returned," Long Arrow said to the doctor, getting off the eagle.

86
00:04:46.237 --> 00:04:50.621
"Now give this to every person and they will be sick no more."

87
00:04:51.201 --> 00:04:53.984
He held out a large jar of herbs and plants.

88
00:04:54.668 --> 00:04:56.631
For the next two days, Dr.

89
00:04:56.671 --> 00:04:59.976
Dolittle and Long Arrow worked together curing the natives.

90
00:05:00.777 --> 00:05:04.904
Soon not one person in the village of Popsipetal was sick.
